From 998ae14686bad10a04794f63baa2d16bac3de291 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: h0cheung <hcheunh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:11:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/48] drm/msm: adreno a8xx: force GX GDSC collapse before CX
 in recovery

On SM8750 (Adreno 830) the GX GDSC lives in the separate gxclkctl domain
and feeds the shader cores plus the CX GDSC power dependency. After a GMU
hang the firmware leaves GX voted on in HW (RPMH), so CX cannot collapse
while GX is up: recovery deadlocks ("cx gdsc didn't collapse") and the
next hw_init times out on GMU OOB GPU_SET, which userspace sees as
VkDeviceLost.

Force GX collapse before the existing CX collapse in a8xx_recover(),
mirroring a6xx_gmu_gxpd_put() but unconditionally, because gx_is_on()
reads false while the GMU is hung.

Imported from arcadematicas/pocknix-odin3-support (0051, AYN Odin 3,
SM8750). Original author: Fransis <arcadematicas@gmail.com>.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_gpu.c | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_gpu.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_gpu.c
index 0f6fd35bd..8a914b6be 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_gpu.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a8xx_gpu.c
@@ -904,6 +904,22 @@ void a8xx_recover(struct msm_gpu *gpu)
 	 */
 	gpu->active_submits = 0;
 
+	/*
+	 * A8xx (SM8750/Adreno 830): the GX GDSC lives in the separate gxclkctl
+	 * domain and feeds the shader cores + the CX GDSC power dependency. On a
+	 * GMU hang the firmware leaves GX voted on in HW (RPMH), so CX cannot
+	 * collapse while GX is up: recovery deadlocks ("cx gdsc didn't
+	 * collapse") and the next hw_init times out on GMU OOB GPU_SET, which
+	 * userspace sees as VkDeviceLost. Force GX collapse BEFORE CX, mirroring
+	 * a6xx_gmu_gxpd_put() (unconditional: gx_is_on() reads false while the
+	 * GMU is hung).
+	 */
+	if (!IS_ERR_OR_NULL(gmu->gxpd)) {
+		pm_runtime_get_sync(gmu->gxpd);
+		dev_pm_genpd_synced_poweroff(gmu->gxpd);
+		pm_runtime_put_sync(gmu->gxpd);
+	}
+
 	reinit_completion(&gmu->pd_gate);
 	dev_pm_genpd_add_notifier(gmu->cxpd, &gmu->pd_nb);
 	dev_pm_genpd_synced_poweroff(gmu->cxpd);
